                <property name="toolTip">
                 <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fetched &lt;span style=" font-weight:600;"&gt;without&lt;/span&gt; any proxy, so features that must tell a dead internet connection apart from dead servers — such as the auto selector — can check the connection itself, and notice the moment it comes back.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Only put a URL here that is reachable &lt;span style=" font-weight:600;"&gt;directly&lt;/span&gt; on your network. Leave it empty to rely on the operating system's network state instead.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
